      "title": { "en": "dsh-remote-access", "zh": "远程操控（Tailscale）" },
      "description": {
        "en": "Remote-control the local DSH through Tailscale: expose the running Web UI to your tailnet, with /remote and a settings page for the login link and QR. Requires the Web UI running, a working Tailscale link and the PC powered on. Built by DeepSeek; human users handle testing and maintenance.",
